WEBVTT

00:13:57.294 --> 00:14:01.929
So yes, I believe in the reality
of animal grief.

00:14:01.953 --> 00:14:04.138
I believe in the reality of animal love,

00:14:04.162 --> 00:14:06.672
and I think it is time for us humans

00:14:06.696 --> 00:14:09.369
to recognize that
we don't own these things.

00:14:09.836 --> 00:14:11.366
And when we see that,

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:15.204
we have an opportunity to make the world
so much better for animals,

00:14:15.228 --> 00:14:17.531
a kinder world, a gentler world,

00:14:17.555 --> 00:14:22.052
and along the way, we might
just save ourselves, too.

00:14:22.076 --> 00:14:23.568
Thank you so much.

00:14:23.592 --> 00:14:25.193
(Applause)

00:14:25.217 --> 00:14:26.980
Thank you. Thank you.

00:14:27.004 --> 00:14:28.833
(Applause)